# 🤖 JA Assure AI Chatbot

An AI-powered chatbot built using Python, Flask and Anthropic Claude.

The project provides a conversational AI interface and includes
an email-report tool that allows the AI agent to send reports
or messages through email.

---

## 🚀 Features

- AI-powered chatbot
- Anthropic Claude integration
- Web-based chat interface
- AI Agent architecture
- Tool/function calling
- Email report generation
- SMTP email integration
- Environment variable based API security

---

